# reports/runtime/.gitkeep
# =============================================================================
# This directory stores all RUNTIME validation reports.
# Reports are grouped by scan_id — one subdirectory per scan.
# =============================================================================
#
# FUTURE DIRECTORY STRUCTURE:
#
#   reports/runtime/
#   ├── SCAN-550e8400/
#   │   ├── prowler-report.json                  — Raw Prowler output
#   │   ├── normalized-runtime-findings.json     — Normalized findings with scan_id
#   │   └── runtime-risk-score.json              — Runtime risk score component
#   │
#   ├── SCAN-a1b2c3d4/
#   │   └── ...
#   │
#   └── SCAN-ff001122/
#       └── ...
#
# DESIGN NOTES:
#   - Each scan_id subdirectory is completely isolated
#   - Runtime findings are linked to their scan_id, which traces back to the
#     specific repository URL, branch, and commit SHA that was scanned
#   - Prowler targets resources tagged with the scan_id in the AWS sandbox,
#     ensuring runtime findings are attributed to the correct scan
#
# All JSON report files are excluded from Git via .gitignore.
# Only this .gitkeep file is tracked by Git.
# =============================================================================
